 "summary": "Invoice tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN (refund tax differs: ROUND_DOWN)",
 "content": "Invoice tax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP. Exception: as of 2026-10-02 finance specified that refund tax rounds with ROUND_DOWN \u2014 see the separate refund-tax memory."
}
